== Effects ==
* Reveals the map of each [[floor]]. It does not identify special rooms and does not reveal the locations of {{r|Secret Room}}s / {{r|Super Secret Room}}s.

== Notes ==
* When combined with {{i|Blue Map}} and {{i|The Compass}}, the entire floor is revealed, identical to the effect of {{i|The Mind}}.
* Although not explicitly revealing it, the {{R|Boss Room}} can ''usually'' be found by locating the room farthest away from the starting room.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Book of Secrets|r}}: Can make it easier to gain {{i|X-Ray Vision}} as Book of Secrets cannot give a mapping effect Isaac already has.
* {{t|Liberty Cap|nr}}: If Liberty Cap triggers the effect of {{i|The Compass}}, it will last for the remainder of the floor.

