== Trivia ==
* Treasure Map received a significant downgrade in ''Rebirth'', as it no longer reveals {{r|Secret Room}}s. That effect, along with being able to reveal {{r|Super Secret Room}}s, now belongs to the {{i|Blue Map}}.
* This item is used in {{chal|Cursed!}}.
* This item is likely a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Legend Of Zelda|Legend of Zelda]]'' franchise, in which dungeon maps are commonplace.
* {{dlc|r}} Under the minimap, {{i|The Mind}}'s icon will override the icon of this item.
* This item can be found as one of the Nintendo-themed {{r|Treasure Room}} items in the 6th of December's [[List of curated daily challenges|Daily Run]], which is an homage to the late CEO of Nintendo, Satoru Iwata.

